  "notes": [
    "Source A38/A41 header snapshot only: cash8012 / gem4219 / blue ticket76 / event token5 / Power Cube5. These are not live or approved balance values.",
    "The source event-token glyph is round/gold; the prepared redticket glyph is a declared red-tag proxy, not an exact currency identity.",
    "The four green plus signs are prepared display images, not new payment/navigation inputs. No action is invented for them.",
    "Pill skin is existing darkbrownpill3 with source caps[0,18,0,18]; keep padding0. All header parts are display-only; native values are separate text.",
    "When using image dropdowns, wait for the expected glyph-atlas src256×192 before applying64×64 crop. Source identity guard is required; bounds alone is insufficient.",
    "Root must delete the already-built old CurrencyValues through normal UI before or after building this group. This recipe itself never edits a saved design.",
    "When copying this group to another shop, preserve same-role geometry, assign target-family names, and rebind the actual visible currencies/counts from that target source. Tempus shows two top resources; do not carry five Limited balances into it or invent zeros.",
    "The existing plus glyph was visually inspected. The 16px leading resource icons and12px plus sprites use explicit existing atlas regions."
